    {
      "id": "37878714",
      "title": "Defining the Details",
      "sourceHash": "43e6513c74328d0a6f3ae707e06b57eb3ef8c04a98da5b7920a004c6caebea21",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 5.19,
          "en": "So after defining your main content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.19,
          "end": 7.08,
          "en": "as I call it here in the image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.08,
          "end": 10.92,
          "en": "you can now continue with the setting, the background,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.92,
          "end": 13.38,
          "en": "and the general atmosphere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.38,
          "end": 15.54,
          "en": "We'll dive into all these key areas",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.54,
          "end": 17.73,
          "en": "in detail in the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.73,
          "end": 19.59,
          "en": "So just an example for the setting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.59,
          "end": 22.08,
          "en": "would be a close up image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.08,
          "end": 24.54,
          "en": "We had such close ups now already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.54,
          "end": 27.06,
          "en": "in the example prompt we generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.06,
          "end": 29.46,
          "en": "So here, it won't change too much probably.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.46,
          "end": 30.87,
          "en": "Still, we will play around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.87,
          "end": 32.91,
          "en": "with the setting a lot in the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.91,
          "end": 35.46,
          "en": "So the setting, so the perspective and so on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.46,
          "end": 38.94,
          "en": "is an important factor you can define in the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.94,
          "end": 41.94,
          "en": "The background so far was barely visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.94,
          "end": 43.38,
          "en": "Here we could say that the ocean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.38,
          "end": 45.6,
          "en": "should be in the background,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.6,
          "end": 49.5,
          "en": "and regarding the atmosphere, lots of things to define here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.5,
          "end": 51.03,
          "en": "Here, for example, we could say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51.03,
          "end": 53.19,
          "en": "that the lighting should be cinematic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 53.19,
          "end": 56.793,
          "en": "so it should have more of this movie kind looks, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.81,
          "end": 62.52,
          "en": "All these areas are referred to as the so-called details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.52,
          "end": 63.96,
          "en": "So whenever you write a prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.96,
          "end": 66.36,
          "en": "you can follow this logic to first define",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.36,
          "end": 68.52,
          "en": "the main content in your prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.52,
          "end": 69.99,
          "en": "and then you add all the details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 69.99,
          "end": 72.18,
          "en": "that define the additional parts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.18,
          "end": 76.17,
          "en": "the additional characteristics of your image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.17,
          "end": 78.093,
          "en": "Coming back to our example now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.38,
          "end": 83.013,
          "en": "this would mean that I simply copy my initial prompt here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.21000000000001,
          "end": 87.45,
          "en": "add it again, and now as we know,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.45,
          "end": 91.17,
          "en": "Midjourney doesn't understand commas and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.17,
          "end": 94.17,
          "en": "For better readability, I typically separate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.17,
          "end": 97.05,
          "en": "the medium and the subject with a comma",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.05,
          "end": 99.87,
          "en": "from the specific details that I add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.87,
          "end": 103.47,
          "en": "So here, I'll add a comma now and define explicitly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.47,
          "end": 105.66,
          "en": "that the image should be a close up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.66,
          "end": 107.75999999999999,
          "en": "which we kind of have already here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 107.75999999999999,
          "end": 109.89,
          "en": "at least in some of the images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.89,
          "end": 112.35,
          "en": "but I only wanna have close ups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.35,
          "end": 115.413,
          "en": "And I'll add the ocean in the background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.72999999999999,
          "end": 118.25999999999999,
          "en": "You could also keep this shorter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.25999999999999,
          "end": 120.96,
          "en": "with ocean in the background or ocean in background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120.96,
          "end": 122.94,
          "en": "As mentioned, I'd like to add some words",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.94,
          "end": 124.92,
          "en": "for better readability,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 128.193,
          "en": "and we wanna have cinematic lighting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.18,
          "end": 132.27,
          "en": "So this is a more specific prompt with more details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 132.27,
          "end": 134.16,
          "en": "And this should also have an impact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 134.16,
          "end": 137.133,
          "en": "on the way the images are generated now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140.67000000000002,
          "end": 143.37,
          "en": "And although the images are not generated yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.37,
          "end": 145.89,
          "en": "you see, for example, that our setting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 145.89,
          "end": 149.16,
          "en": "with the closeup gives us much better detailed shots",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.16,
          "end": 151.35,
          "en": "of the face of the pirate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.35,
          "end": 153.63,
          "en": "If you compare it, for example, to this image here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.63,
          "end": 155.97,
          "en": "that we had in our more generic prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.97,
          "end": 159.45,
          "en": "we can already see the ocean in the background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 159.45,
          "end": 162.69,
          "en": "So Midjourney also added this ocean in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 162.69,
          "end": 164.43,
          "en": "And if we compare the lighting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 164.43,
          "end": 166.71,
          "en": "you'll see this is a more cinematic look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 166.71,
          "end": 168.99,
          "en": "Actually, it's a brighter look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 168.99,
          "end": 171.9,
          "en": "than the one we had before in the first prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 171.9,
          "end": 176.493,
          "en": "And if I now have a look at the full quality images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 177.72,
          "end": 180,
          "en": "then I know that this is a subjective thing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 180,
          "end": 183.903,
          "en": "but in my opinion, this looks absolutely stunning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 184.8,
          "end": 188.46,
          "en": "For example, this image here could be taken straight off",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.46,
